<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 600 mln of 10-yr bonds on Jan 14.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 600 mln of 10-yr bonds on Jan 14.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish treasury offered to sell 600 million zlotys of ten-year floating bonds maturing on January 18, 2007 at a tender on January 14, 1997, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>The value date for this auction is January 22, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
